{"articleNo":"422895","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=422895&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] [학부] 2023학년 1학기 학제간공유형 교육과정 교과 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.01.18","hit":"5523","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font face=\"Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif\">학제간공유형교육과정에 대해 다음과 같이 안내하오니, 수강신청에 참고하시기 바랍니다.</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1. 학제간공유형교육과정&nbsp;:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">공학적 문제에 대한 창의적이고 융합적인 접근 및 해결을 위해 요구되는 타 전공의&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">이해를 위해 각 학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">에서 개설하는&nbsp;<b>비전공자를 위한</b>&nbsp;전공 기초 또는 신기술 동향에 대한 교과목을 공동 편성한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">것이다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">학제간 공유형 교육과정은&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">차산업혁명 시대에 부합하는 창의적 문제 해결 능력을 갖춘 융합적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">통섭적 인재 양성을 목표로 한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6848\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2. 2023-1학기 개설 교과 : 건축/토목계열 DS0016(파이썬지반응용해석</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">)</span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b>3. 수강신청 : <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">개설교과계열 소속학부(과)를 제외한 나머지 학부(과) 학생</span>만 수강신청 가능</b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b>&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">ex)건축/토목계열 교과의 경우&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">건축/토목</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">계열 소속학부(과) 수강신청 불가</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; <span style=\"color: rgb(102, 0, 255);\">※</span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 0, 255);\">학기당</span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(102, 0, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 0, 255);\">학점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 0, 255);\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 0, 255);\">최대&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(102, 0, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 0, 255);\">학점이내로 이수가능</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">4. 이수구분 : 전공선택</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px;